+# Plan: Cancel a booking
+Add `cancel` to `RentalService` in `src/index.ts`. Cancelling removes the booking from the internal
+`bookings` list (so overlap checks and `availability` free it) and records its id in a `cancelled` set so
+a second cancel is reported as already cancelled. Tests in `test/rental.test.ts`.
